INSERT INTO `GAC_posts` VALUES (3,1,'2024-04-18 07:32:56','2024-04-18 07:32:56','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Privacy Policy','','draft','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2024-04-18 07:32:56','2024-04-18 07:32:56','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),(4,0,'2024-04-18 07:33:40','2024-04-18 07:33:40','<label> Je naam\n    [text* your-name autocomplete:name] </label>\n\n<label> Je e-mailadres\n    [email* your-email autocomplete:email] </label>\n\n<label> Onderwerp\n    [text* your-subject] </label>\n\n<label> Je bericht (optioneel)\n    [textarea your-message] </label>\n\n[submit \"Verzenden\"]\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <wordpress@hardlopen.virgilsmit.com>\nVan: [your-name] [your-email]\nOnderwerp: [your-subject]\n\nBerichtinhoud:\n[your-message]\n\n-- \nDit is een bericht dat er een contactformulier is ingediend op je site ([_site_title] [_site_url]).\n[_site_admin_email]\nReply-To: [your-email]\n\n0\n0\n\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <wordpress@hardlopen.virgilsmit.com>\nBerichtinhoud:\n[your-message]\n\n-- \nDeze e-mail is een ontvangstbevestiging voor je contactformulier op onze site ([_site_title] [_site_url]) waarbij je e-mailadres is gebruikt. Als je dat niet was, negeer dit bericht dan.\n[your-email]\nReply-To: [_site_admin_email]\n\n0\n0\nBedankt voor je bericht. Het is verzonden.\nEr is een fout opgetreden bij het versturen van het bericht; probeer het later nog eens.\nEen of meer velden bevatten een fout; graag controleren en opnieuw proberen.\nEr is een fout opgetreden bij het versturen van het bericht; probeer het later nog eens.\nJe moet de voorwaarden accepteren voordat je het bericht kunt verzenden.\nVul dit veld in.\nDit veld heeft een te grote invoer.\nDit veld heeft een te korte invoer.\nEr is een onbekende fout opgetreden bij het uploaden van het bestand.\nJe hebt geen toestemming om bestanden van dit type te uploaden.\nHet geüploade bestand is te groot.\nEr is een fout opgetreden bij het uploaden van het bestand.','Contactformulier 1','','publish','closed','closed','','contactformulier-1','','','2024-04-18 07:33:40','2024-04-18 07:33:40','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&p=4',0,'wpcf7_contact_form','',0),(5,0,'2024-04-18 07:37:44','2024-04-18 07:37:44','<!-- wp:home-link {\"label\":\"Home\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Blog\",\"type\":\"page\",\"id\":20,\"url\":\"https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=20\",\"kind\":\"post-type\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Contact\",\"type\":\"page\",\"id\":19,\"url\":\"https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=19\",\"kind\":\"post-type\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Registratie Virgil groep\",\"type\":\"page\",\"id\":62,\"url\":\"https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=62\",\"kind\":\"post-type\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Hardloopgroepen GAC\",\"type\":\"link\",\"opensInNewTab\":true,\"url\":\"https://gach.nl/trainingen/hardlopen/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Schema Virgil\",\"type\":\"page\",\"id\":100,\"url\":\"https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=100\",\"kind\":\"post-type\"} /-->','Navigatie','','publish','closed','closed','','navigation','','','2024-05-02 15:41:41','2024-05-02 15:41:41','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=5',0,'wp_navigation','',0),(6,0,'2024-04-18 07:56:30','2024-04-18 07:56:30','','Standaard kit','','publish','closed','closed','','standaard-kit','','','2025-01-13 20:46:37','2025-01-13 20:46:37','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=6',0,'elementor_library','',0),(10,1,'2024-04-18 10:06:24','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','draft','open','open','','','','','2024-04-18 10:06:24','2024-04-18 10:06:24','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?post_type=e-landing-page&#038;p=10',0,'e-landing-page','',0),(11,1,'2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','',10,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=11',0,'revision','',0),(12,1,'2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','',10,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=12',0,'revision','',0),(13,1,'2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','',10,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=13',0,'revision','',0),(14,1,'2024-04-18 10:05:08','2024-04-18 10:05:08','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:06:24','2024-04-18 10:06:24','',10,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=14',0,'revision','',0),(15,1,'2024-04-18 10:06:24','2024-04-18 10:06:24','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:06:25','2024-04-18 10:06:25','',10,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=15',0,'revision','',0),(16,1,'2024-04-18 10:06:24','2024-04-18 10:06:24','','Elementor Landingspagina #10','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:06:24','2024-04-18 10:06:24','',10,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=16',0,'revision','',0),(17,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Loopgroep AB - 1,5 uur</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">De startersclinic is afgelopen en nu is het mogelijk om naar een vaste groep te gaan. Als je dit nog niet weet, kan je even blijven doorlopen tot je een keuze hebt gemaakt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Loopgroep Virgil','','draft','closed','closed','','home','','','2025-01-13 16:27:19','2025-01-13 16:27:19','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=17',0,'page','',0),(18,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welkom bij de hardloopgroep van Virgil Smit, onderdeel van de <strong>Gooise Atletiek Club (GAC)</strong> in Hilversum! Wij zijn een enthousiaste groep hardlopers die samen werken aan techniek, conditie en vooral plezier in het hardlopen. Of je nu beginner bent of een ervaren loper, iedereen is welkom!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Onze missie is simpel: <strong>plezier in hardlopen</strong>, gecombineerd met persoonlijke groei en het behalen van jouw doelen.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Wat bieden wij?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Professionele begeleiding</strong>: Onder leiding van Virgil Smit, ervaren trainer en coach, krijg je trainingen die gericht zijn op techniek, conditieopbouw en blessurepreventie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Structuur en uitdaging</strong>: Onze schema’s bieden duidelijke opbouw en flexibiliteit, zodat je kunt trainen voor een 5 km, 10 km of zelfs een halve marathon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Gezelligheid en motivatie</strong>: Hardlopen in een groep is niet alleen leuker, maar ook motiverender!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Waarom kiezen voor ons?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bij ons draait het om méér dan alleen hardlopen. Wij bieden:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Techniektrainingen</strong> om blessurevrij te blijven.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Duurlooptrainingen</strong> voor ontspanning en conditieopbouw.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Een toegankelijke en gezellige sfeer, waar iedereen zichzelf kan zijn.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Evenementen en activiteiten</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We organiseren elk halfjaar een gevarieerd programma, met als hoogtepunten een aantal hardloopevenementen waar je aan mee kunt doen. Dit halfjaar zijn dat:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Vechtstreek in Beweging (VIB-loop)</strong> – Zondag 23 februari 2025 (<a href=\"https://www.viblopen.nl\">Meer info</a>)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Lenteloop (Lentemarathon)</strong> – Zondag 16 maart 2025 (<a href=\"https://www.lentemarathon.nl/inschrijven/\">Inschrijven</a>)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Hilversum City Run</strong> – Zondag 13 april 2025 (<a href=\"https://www.hilversumcityrun.nl\">Meer info</a>)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• <strong>Kasteelloop De Haar</strong> – Zondag 22 juni 2025 (<a href=\"https://www.kasteelloopdehaar.nl\">Meer info</a>)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Samen trainen we naar deze evenementen toe en zorgen we dat jij met plezier en zelfvertrouwen aan de start staat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Sluit je aan!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wil jij ook ervaren hoe leuk en motiverend hardlopen in een groep kan zijn? Neem contact met ons op via <a href=\"https://gach.nl/\">de website van GAC Hilversum</a> of kom vrijblijvend meetrainen. Samen maken we hardlopen niet alleen effectiever, maar vooral veel leuker!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Over ons','','publish','closed','closed','','over-ons','','','2025-01-13 20:35:00','2025-01-13 20:35:00','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=18',0,'page','',0),(19,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Heb je vragen, vul dan het formulier in</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:contact-form-7/contact-form-selector {\"id\":47,\"hash\":\"4a61590\",\"title\":\"Aanmelden AB Groep\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-contact-form-7-contact-form-selector\">[contact-form-7 id=\"4a61590\" title=\"Aanmelden AB Groep\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:contact-form-7/contact-form-selector -->','Contact','','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2024-04-18 11:41:41','2024-04-18 11:41:41','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?page_id=19',0,'page','',0),(22,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','',17,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=22',0,'revision','',0),(23,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Je bent misschien wel een artiest die zichzelf en je werk hier wil voorstellen of misschien heb je een bedrijf met een missie om te beschrijven.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Over ons','','inherit','closed','closed','','18-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','',18,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=23',0,'revision','',0),(24,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dit is een pagina met wat eenvoudige contactinformatie, zoals een adres en telefoonnummer. Je kunt ook een plugin proberen om een contactformulier toe te voegen.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Maak binnen enkele minuten je <a href=\"https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=wpforms-overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contactformulier</a> met WPForms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Contact','','inherit','closed','closed','','19-revision-v1','','','2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','',19,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=24',0,'revision','',0),(26,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=26',0,'nav_menu_item','',0),(27,1,'2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','27','','','2024-04-18 10:10:25','2024-04-18 10:10:25','',0,'https://hardlopen.virgilsmit.com/?p=27',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(28,1,'2024-04-18 10:34:26','2024-04-18 10:10:26',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','2